<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>PayloadType</key>
	<string>Configuration</string>
	<key>PayloadVersion</key>
	<integer>1</integer>
	<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
	<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS</string>
	<key>PayloadUUID</key>
	<string>0AEA2EE2-6414-57C2-8722-029EE56E65F7</string>
	<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
	<string>howToSafeDNS · RethinkDNS · DoT</string>
	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>This file contains a single DNS configuration only. It does not include a root certificate, VPN, device management enrollment or app installation. You can inspect the XML source on GitHub.

The profile is unsigned. “Unsigned” means it has no distributor signature; this is separate from the DNS connection's TLS encryption. Check the name and DNS addresses on the installation screen before deciding to install.

Public encrypted DNS requiring no account. The max endpoint runs on Fly.io.

The operator states that DNS query logs are not stored by default. Logging and analytics explicitly enabled by paying users are exceptions, and the hosting provider's policies also apply.

Privacy policy: https://rethinkdns.com/privacy</string>
	<key>PayloadScope</key>
	<string>System</string>
	<key>PayloadContent</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>PayloadType</key>
			<string>com.apple.dnsSettings.managed</string>
			<key>PayloadVersion</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
			<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS.dns</string>
			<key>PayloadUUID</key>
			<string>FCF3CCBD-2448-5BC4-8148-A22770F9B376</string>
			<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
			<string>howToSafeDNS · RethinkDNS · DoT</string>
			<key>DNSSettings</key>
			<dict>
				<key>DNSProtocol</key>
				<string>TLS</string>
				<key>ServerName</key>
				<string>max.rethinkdns.com</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
